\item[S1] ULAM.AI and the UnsolvedMath Contributors, UnsolvedMath, record 30003184 (OWR-14744-001). Catalogue curation under CC BY 4.0; definitions and English exposition added locally.
\url{https://huggingface.co/datasets/ulamai/UnsolvedMath}.
